
================================================================================
  SHIELD AI — Indian Health Insurance AI Platform
  Complete Project Documentation
================================================================================

OVERVIEW
--------
Shield AI is a full-stack AI-powered web application built for the Indian health
insurance domain. It combines two intelligent systems into a single clean UI:

  1. RAG Chatbot (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)
     An AI assistant that answers questions about Indian health insurance —
     policies, claims, regulations, terminology, disease coverage, and more.
     It retrieves relevant knowledge from a curated local database and sends
     it as context to the Mistral AI language model to generate accurate answers.

  2. Premium Calculator (ML Prediction)
     A machine learning model (XGBoost) that predicts the estimated annual
     insurance premium in INR based on the user's personal and health profile:
     age, gender, BMI, number of children, smoking status, pre-existing disease,
     and policy type.

The app uses a React + TypeScript frontend (Vite) and a Python FastAPI backend.
Both communicate over HTTP REST APIs running locally.


