--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/index.html
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The HTML shell for the single-page application. Minimal by design — Vite
injects the bundled JS at build time.

  - DOCTYPE html5, lang="en"
  - Meta charset UTF-8 and viewport for responsive scaling
  - Favicon linked to /vite.svg
  - Single <div id="root"> — React mounts here
  - <script type="module" src="/src/main.tsx"> — ES module entry point
  - Page title is "frontend" (can be changed to "Shield AI")

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/src/main.tsx
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
React DOM bootstrap file. Minimal — just mounts the app.

  - Imports StrictMode from React (enables extra runtime warnings in dev)
  - Imports createRoot from react-dom/client
  - Imports index.css (global reset styles)
  - Imports App component
  - Calls createRoot(document.getElementById('root')!).render(...)
  - Wraps <App /> in <StrictMode> for development safety checks

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/src/App.tsx
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The entire application UI lives in this single component file. All state,
logic, and rendering is here.

  STATE VARIABLES:
    activeTab   "chat" | "predict"
                Controls which view is displayed. Defaults to "chat".

    question    string
                Bound to the chat input field. Cleared after each send.

    chatLog     Array<{ role: "user" | "bot", text: string }>
                Stores the full conversation history. Each message has a role
                and text. Rendered as message bubbles in the chat window.

    isLoading   boolean
                True while waiting for an API response. Disables inputs,
                shows typing indicator in chat, shows spinner on predict button.

    form        { age, sex, bmi, children, smoker, disease, policy_type }
                Holds all premium calculator form values. Defaults:
                  age=30, sex=1, bmi=24, children=0, smoker=0,
                  disease=5 (None), policy_type=1 (Individual)

    premium     number | null
                Holds the last predicted premium result. null = not yet predicted.
                When set, the result banner is shown below the form.

  EFFECTS:
    useEffect on [chatLog, isLoading]
      Calls chatEndRef.current?.scrollIntoView({ behavior: "smooth" })
      Auto-scrolls the chat window to the latest message whenever a new
      message is added or loading state changes.

  FUNCTIONS:

    askBot()
      - Returns early if question is empty/whitespace
      - Saves question text, clears the input field
      - Appends user message to chatLog
      - Sets isLoading = true
      - POSTs { question } to http://127.0.0.1:8000/chat via axios
      - On success: appends bot response to chatLog
      - On error: appends "Sorry, I couldn't process your request." to chatLog
      - Sets isLoading = false

    predictPremium()
      - Sets isLoading = true
      - POSTs the entire form object to http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict via axios
      - On success: sets premium state to res.data.premium
      - On error: shows alert "Failed to calculate premium. Please try again."
      - Sets isLoading = false

    handleKeyPress(e)
      - Listens for Enter key on the chat input
      - If Enter is pressed without Shift, prevents default and calls askBot()
      - Shift+Enter allows multi-line input (though textarea is not used here)

  UI LAYOUT:

    .layout (flex row)
    |
    |-- .sidebar (dark navy, 300px wide)
    |   |-- .logo-section
    |   |   |-- Shield emoji icon (floating animation)
    |   |   |-- "Shield AI" heading
    |   |   |-- "Smart Insurance Solutions" tagline
    |   |-- .nav-section
    |       |-- "AI Assistant" nav button (activeTab = "chat")
    |       |-- "Premium Calculator" nav button (activeTab = "predict")
    |
    |-- .main-content (flex 1, scrollable)
        |
        |-- [if activeTab === "chat"] .elegant-card.chat-card
        |   |-- .card-header
        |   |   |-- "Insurance Assistant" title + subtitle
        |   |   |-- Online status badge (green pulsing dot)
        |   |-- .chat-window (scrollable, flex column)
        |   |   |-- Empty state (shown when chatLog is empty)
        |   |   |   |-- Lightbulb icon, "How can I help you today?"
        |   |   |   |-- Hint text about what to ask
        |   |   |-- Message bubbles (mapped from chatLog)
        |   |   |   |-- User messages: right-aligned, blue background
        |   |   |   |-- Bot messages: left-aligned, white with border, robot emoji
        |   |   |-- Typing indicator (shown when isLoading=true)
        |   |   |   |-- Three bouncing dots animation
        |   |   |-- chatEndRef div (scroll anchor)
        |   |-- .chat-input-container
        |       |-- Text input (disabled when loading)
        |       |-- Send button (disabled when empty or loading)
        |
        |-- [if activeTab === "predict"] .elegant-card.predict-card
            |-- .card-header
            |   |-- "Premium Calculator" title + subtitle
            |-- .form-container
            |   |-- Section: "Personal Information"
            |   |   |-- Age (number input, min 18, max 100)
            |   |   |-- Gender (select: Male=1, Female=0)
            |   |   |-- BMI (number input, step 0.1, hint: normal 18.5-24.9)
            |   |   |-- Number of Children (number input, min 0, max 10)
            |   |-- Section: "Health & Lifestyle"
            |   |   |-- Smoking Status (select: Non-Smoker=0, Smoker=1)
            |   |   |-- Pre-existing Condition (select: None=5, Diabetes=1,
            |   |       Hypertension=3, Heart Disease=2, Asthma=0, Multiple=4)
            |   |-- Section: "Policy Details"
            |   |   |-- Policy Type (select: Individual=1, Family Floater=0,
            |   |       Senior Citizen=2)
            |   |-- "Calculate Premium" button (spinner when loading)
            |-- .result-banner (shown only when premium !== null)
                |-- Sparkle icon with bounce animation
                |-- "Estimated Annual Premium" label
                |-- Premium amount formatted as ₹XX,XX,XXX (Indian locale)
                |-- Disclaimer note about estimate accuracy

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/src/App.css
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Complete stylesheet for the entire application. Uses CSS custom properties
(variables) for consistent theming throughout.

  CSS VARIABLES (defined on :root):
    --sidebar-blue:   #0f172a  (dark navy sidebar background)
    --accent-blue:    #2563eb  (primary action color — buttons, active states)
    --accent-hover:   #1d4ed8  (darker blue for hover states)
    --bg-light:       #f8fafc  (main content background)
    --bg-grey:        #f1f5f9  (chat window background)
    --text-dark:      #1e293b  (primary text)
    --text-medium:    #475569  (secondary text)
    --text-light:     #64748b  (hint/placeholder text)
    --border:         #e2e8f0  (card and input borders)
    --success:        #10b981  (green for result banner and status dot)
    --success-bg:     #ecfdf5  (light green result banner background)
    --success-border: #a7f3d0  (green border for result banner)
    --shadow-sm/md/lg/xl       (layered box shadows for depth)

  ANIMATIONS:
    float     — Logo icon bobs up and down every 3 seconds
    pulse     — Online status dot fades in/out every 2 seconds
    slideIn   — Messages slide up and fade in when added to chat
    typing    — Three dots bounce sequentially (0, 0.2s, 0.4s delay)
    spin      — Loading spinner rotates continuously
    bounce    — Result icon bounces once when premium is shown

  KEY COMPONENT STYLES:
    .layout           flex row, full viewport height, overflow hidden
    .sidebar          300px wide, dark gradient, flex column
    .nav-btn          full width, transparent, hover slides right 4px,
                      active state has left blue border accent
    .chat-card        flex column, height calc(100vh - 6rem), max 900px
    .chat-window      flex 1, scrollable, custom scrollbar styling
    .message.user     blue background, right-aligned, bottom-right radius 4px
    .message.bot      white background, border, bottom-left radius 4px
    .form-grid        2-column CSS grid, collapses to 1 column at 1024px
    .result-banner    green gradient background, slide-in animation
    .result-amount    3rem font, green color, Indian locale formatting

  RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS:
    1024px  Form grid collapses to single column, sidebar narrows to 250px
    768px   Layout stacks vertically (sidebar on top), card header stacks,
            messages expand to 85% width, result actions stack vertically

