--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/vite.config.ts
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vite build configuration.

  - Uses @vitejs/plugin-react for React JSX transform and Fast Refresh
  - Enables babel-plugin-react-compiler (experimental React 19 compiler)
    This automatically optimises component re-renders — equivalent to
    manually adding useMemo/useCallback everywhere, but automatic.
  - Default dev server runs on port 5173
  - No custom aliases or proxy config (API calls go directly to :8000)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/tsconfig.app.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
TypeScript compiler options for the application source code.

  target:                ES2022
  lib:                   ES2022, DOM, DOM.Iterable
  module:                ESNext
  moduleResolution:      bundler (Vite-compatible)
  jsx:                   react-jsx (no React import needed in every file)
  strict:                true (all strict checks enabled)
  noUnusedLocals:        true
  noUnusedParameters:    true
  noEmit:                true (Vite handles bundling, TS only type-checks)
  allowImportingTsExtensions: true
  verbatimModuleSyntax:  true
  erasableSyntaxOnly:    true

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/tsconfig.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Root TypeScript config. Uses project references pattern.
  - No compilerOptions of its own
  - References tsconfig.app.json (for src/) and tsconfig.node.json (for vite.config.ts)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/eslint.config.js
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ESLint flat config (ESLint v9 format).

  - Targets all .ts and .tsx files
  - Extends: eslint recommended, typescript-eslint recommended,
             react-hooks recommended, react-refresh vite preset
  - Browser globals enabled
  - ecmaVersion: 2020
  - Ignores the dist/ build output directory

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  frontend/package.json
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NPM project configuration.

